OL,3,AWe bought our #242,000 home without a
OL,4,Adeposit - here's how
OL,5,
OL,6,FUntil last year, Conroy, 32, and his
OL,7,Fpartner Amber, 28, saw little prospect
OL,8,Fof owning their own home. They were
OL,9,Frenting in central Manchester where
OL,10,Fthey work and could not afford to save
OL,11,Fup for a deposit.
OL,13,FThen they came across a relatively
OL,14,Fniche, and some experts say riskier,
OL,15,Ftype of mortgage that offered a
OL,16,Fsolution.
OL,18,FThe Track Record mortgage from Skipton
OL,19,FBuilding Society covers 100% of the
OL,20,Fvalue of a property, with the borrower
OL,21,Fpaying nothing upfront.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  BusinessC Nat TVF  Nat News
