OL,3,AWe bought our #242,000 home without a
OL,4,Adeposit - here's how
OL,5,
OL,6,FBorrowers must meet strict eligibility
OL,7,Fchecks and pay a higher interest rate -
OL,8,Fin Conroy and Amber's case 5.33% fixed
OL,9,Ffor five years - but they were happy to
OL,10,Fdo this. And in August they bought a
OL,11,Ffour-bed home for #242,000 in Swinton
OL,12,Fon the edge of Manchester.
